  "comments": "Generic name for the seven works of epistemology composed by Dharmak\u012brti (ID:3773), including the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772), Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya (ID:3774), Ny\u0101yabindu (ID:5589), Hetubindu (ID:5831), Sant\u0101n\u0101ntarasiddhi (ID:7068), V\u0101dany\u0101ya (ID:3777), Sambandhapar\u012bk\u1e63\u0101 (ID:3775).\r\n\r\nThe seven are frequently split into a group of three - Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772), Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya (ID:3774), Ny\u0101yabindu (ID:5589) - and a group of four - Hetubindu (ID:5831), Sant\u0101n\u0101ntarasiddhi (ID:7068), V\u0101dany\u0101ya (ID:3777), Sambandhapar\u012bk\u1e63\u0101 (ID:3775).",
